---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import AdSenseAd from '../../components/AdSenseAd.astro';
import Card from '../../components/Card.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="狗狗人類年齡換算計算機 | 專業寵物年齡對照表" description="一鍵計算狗狗等於人類幾歲！專業寵物年齡換算器，提供品種體型差異對照表與老化照護建議。">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto mt-12 px-6">
    <Card className="mb-8">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6">狗狗年齡換算計算機</h1>
      
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <div class="space-y-2">
            <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700">狗狗年齡</label>
            <input type="number" id="dogAge" class="w-full px-4 py-3 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-lg focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 outline-none" placeholder="輸入歲數">
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-2">
            <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700">狗狗體型</label>
            <select id="dogSize" class="w-full px-4 py-3 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-lg focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 outline-none">
              <option value="small">小型犬</option>
              <option value="medium">中型犬</option>
              <option value="large">大型犬</option>
            </select>
          </div>
        </div>
        <button id="calcBtn" class="w-full bg-slate-900 text-white py-4 rounded-xl font-bold hover:bg-slate-800 transition-all">計算對應人類歲數</button>
        <div id="result" class="p-6 bg-blue-50 rounded-2xl text-center text-xl font-bold text-blue-900 hidden"></div>
      </div>
    </Card>

    <AdSenseAd format="rectangle" />

    <section class="prose prose-slate max-w-none mt-12">
      <h2>為什麼狗狗年齡不是乘以 7？</h2>
      <p>過去常見的「狗一歲等於人類七歲」觀念並不準確，因為狗狗在生命早期的發育速度極快，且體型大小會顯著影響老化速度...</p>
      
      <h2>狗狗人類年齡對照表</h2>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto">
        <table class="w-full text-left">
          <thead><tr><th class="p-2 border-b">狗狗歲數</th><th class="p-2 border-b">換算人類歲數</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody><tr><td class="p-2 border-b">1歲</td><td class="p-2 border-b">約15歲</td></tr></tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <h2 class="mt-8">常見問題 (FAQ)</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div><strong>Q: 大型犬與小型犬壽命差異？</strong><br>A: 一般來說小型犬壽命較長，大型犬老化速度較快。</div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="mt-12 flex justify-between border-t pt-8">
      <a href="/tools/cat-age-calculator" class="text-blue-600 font-semibold">→ 貓咪年齡計算機</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    // API logic will be called here
  </script>
</BaseLayout>
